                        <h2 class="mb-0 pb-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block libre-caslon font-weight-normal pt-lg-2">
                            Step 2
                        </h2>
                        <div class="recipe-step-desc common-desc-text pb-4 pb-lg-0 pt-lg-0 libre-caslon" itemprop="recipeInstructions">
                            Add the hoisin sauce, fish sauce, tamari and Sriracha. Simmer for a few minutes to allow flavors to meld. Remove from the heat and stir in the mint, cilantro and grated carrot.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

